<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/yA/tr/y_x5f_a_x7e__x7e_h0_x5f_05_x5f_ati/ati_x2d_1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "<div n=\"1\"> 1) {%проходить мимо%}: {#mAtiyAsIH#}\n<ls>BHAṬṬ. 2,51.</ls> (место) {%проезжать, проходить мимо, обгонять; superare%}: {#(raTaH) yenA^tiyA\\To du^ri\\tAni\\ viSvA^#}\n<ls>ṚV. 5,77,3.</ls>\n<ls>AV. 13,2,5.</ls> {#a\\po DanvA\\nyati^ yATo\\ ajrA^n#}\n<ls>ṚV. 6,62,2.</ls> <ls n=\"ṚV.\">9,15,6.</ls> {#grAmAn — puzpitAni vanAni ca . paSyannatiyayO SIGraM SarEriva hayottamEH ..#}\n<ls>R. 2,49,3.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,49,\">8.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,\">57,4.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,\">71,4.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,71,\">8.</ls> {#˚yAta#} с <ab>act.</ab> <ab>Bed.</ab>\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 1,6,14.</ls> Сюда, вероятно, относится также {#a\\SvIva\\ tA~ ati^ yeza\\M#} (от {#yez#} по\n<ls>SĀY.</ls>) {#raTe^na#}\n<ls>ṚV. 2,27,16.</ls>"@ru ;
  pwglex:sourceGloss "<div n=\"1\"> 1) {%vorübergehen%}: {#mAtiyAsIH#}\n<ls>BHAṬṬ. 2,51.</ls> (einen Ort) {%passiren, vorüberkommen an, überholen; superare%}: {#(raTaH) yenA^tiyA\\To du^ri\\tAni\\ viSvA^#}\n<ls>ṚV. 5,77,3.</ls>\n<ls>AV. 13,2,5.</ls> {#a\\po DanvA\\nyati^ yATo\\ ajrA^n#}\n<ls>ṚV. 6,62,2.</ls> <ls n=\"ṚV.\">9,15,6.</ls> {#grAmAn — puzpitAni vanAni ca . paSyannatiyayO SIGraM SarEriva hayottamEH ..#}\n<ls>R. 2,49,3.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,49,\">8.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,\">57,4.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,\">71,4.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 2,71,\">8.</ls> {#˚yAta#} mit <ab>act.</ab> <ab>Bed.</ab>\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 1,6,14.</ls> Hierher gehört wohl auch {#a\\SvIva\\ tA~ ati^ yeza\\M#} (von {#yez#} nach\n<ls>SĀY.</ls>) {#raTe^na#}\n<ls>ṚV. 2,27,16.</ls>"@de ;
  pwglex:senseTag "ati-1" ;
  pwglex:homonym "h0" ;
  pwglex:equivalenceType "equivalent" ;
  pwglex:sourceType "attested" ;
  pwglex:differentia "«Vorübergehen» = проходить мимо; «passiren/vorüberkommen» = проезжать мимо; «überholen» = обгонять. Три близких значения с нарастающей степенью превосходства."@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:machine-preview ;
  pwglex:model "claude-sonnet-5" ;
  prov:generatedAtTime "2026-06-29T12:37:38Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  dct:references <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/AV_x2e__x2d_13_x2c_2_x2c_5_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/BHA_xe1__xb9__xac__xe1__xb9__xac__x2e__x2d_2_x2c_51_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/BH_xc4__x80_G_x2e__x2d_P_x2e__x2d_1_x2c_6_x2c_14_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/R_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_49_x2c_3_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/R_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_49_x2c__x2d_8_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/R_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_71_x2c__x2d_8_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/R_x2e__x2d_2_x2c__x2d_57_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/R_x2e__x2d_2_x2c__x2d_71_x2c_4_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/S_xc4__x80_Y_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_27_x2c_16_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_5_x2c_77_x2c_3_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_6_x2c_62_x2c_2_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_9_x2c_15_x2c_6_x2e_> ;
